  "subject": "the fourth round of interviews for the same job, in a cousin's borrowed suit",
  "caption": "Mandarin grunge in the early-90s Seattle loud-quiet-loud mould. A detuned overdriven guitar through a fuzz pedal, clean and wobbly in the verses and slamming into a sludgy wall in the chorus; a distorted bass doubling the riff; loose, heavy drums with crashing cymbals; guitar feedback between sections. Thick and murky, garage-room drums, little polish. Male baritone, flat and mumbled in the verses, raw and shouted in the chorus. 92 BPM, E minor. Numb, sardonic, slowly boiling over. No pop-punk bounce, no metalcore breakdown, no screamed growls, no synths, no autotune.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - detuned guitar riff and loose drums]\n\n[Verse 1]\n同一間會議室 同一杯溫水\n西裝是表哥的 袖子長了一截\n他們問我五年後在哪裡\n我說應該還在這張椅子上\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n冷氣開那麼強\n我的手心還是濕的\n\n[Chorus]\n第四輪 第四輪\n他們說只是聊一聊\n我把笑容折好放在桌上\n等他們說 回去等通知\n\n[Verse 2]\n電梯裡碰到上一輪的那個人\n他也穿著不合身的外套\n我們都沒說話 只是點頭\n十七樓到一樓 怎麼那麼久\n\n[Bridge - bass and feedback only]\n如果還有第五輪\n我想穿自己的衣服來\n\n[Chorus - shouted, full fuzz wall]\n第四輪 第四輪\n他們說只是聊一聊\n我把領帶扯下來塞進口袋\n走出大門 才發現外面在下雨\n\n[Outro - guitar feedback]\n表哥打電話來問\n西裝什麼時候還",
